  "body_html": "<p>여정에서 얻게 되는 추종자들을 적어 두는 칸과, 플레이어가 여기서 무엇을 해야 하는지 일깨워 주는 요약. 추종자는 몬스터와 아주 비슷한 능력치 일습에 더해 <strong>대가</strong> 와 <strong>충성</strong> 을 가진다 — <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"npcs-followers.html\" data-slug=\"npcs-followers\">NPC와 추종자</a> 를 보라. 각 추종자 아래의 HP 트래커는 테이블 전체가 공유한다.</p>\n<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"follower\" data-hp-key=\"follower-1\" data-label=\"Follower 1\">\n<h2 id=\"follower-1\">추종자 1</h2>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">이름</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"이름\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">태그</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-tags\" placeholder=\"tags\" aria-label=\"태그\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"f1-tag0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f1-tag0\" data-check-id=\"f1-tag0\"> <span><em>걸출</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"f1-tag1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f1-tag1\" data-check-id=\"f1-tag1\"> <span><em>집단</em></span></label></li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-stats\"><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-max-hp\" data-default=\"6\" value=\"6\" aria-label=\"최대 HP\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"1\" data-spin-max=\"99\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"99\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">최대 HP</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-armor\" data-default=\"0\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"방어구\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"0\" data-spin-max=\"9\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"9\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">방어구</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-damage\" data-default=\"d6\" value=\"d6\" aria-label=\"피해\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-track-name pb-roll\" data-roll-damage=\"d6\" title=\"피해 굴림\">피해</button></div></div><div class=\"fs-hp-mount\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">본능</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-instinct\" placeholder=\"to …\" aria-label=\"~하기\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-moves\"><span class=\"fs-label\">무브</span><ol><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-move0\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"무브\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-move1\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"무브\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-move2\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"무브\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ol></div>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">대가</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-cost\" placeholder=\"what keeps them following\" aria-label=\"계속 따르게 하는 것\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"f1-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">충성</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f1-loyalty-0\" title=\"충성 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f1-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"f1-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"충성 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f1-loyalty-1\" title=\"충성 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f1-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"f1-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"충성 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f1-loyalty-2\" title=\"충성 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f1-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"f1-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"충성 3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-gear\"><span class=\"fs-label\">장비</span><ul><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear0\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear2\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear3\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear4\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear5\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><span class=\"fs-label\">메모</span><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-notes\" rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"메모\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"follower\" data-hp-key=\"follower-2\" data-label=\"Follower 2\">\n<h2 id=\"follower-2\">추종자 2</h2>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">이름</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"이름\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">태그</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-tags\" placeholder=\"tags\" aria-label=\"태그\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"f2-tag0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f2-tag0\" data-check-id=\"f2-tag0\"> <span><em>걸출</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"f2-tag1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f2-tag1\" data-check-id=\"f2-tag1\"> <span><em>집단</em></span></label></li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-stats\"><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-max-hp\" data-default=\"6\" value=\"6\" aria-label=\"최대 HP\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"1\" data-spin-max=\"99\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"99\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">최대 HP</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-armor\" data-default=\"0\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"방어구\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"0\" data-spin-max=\"9\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"9\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">방어구</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-damage\" data-default=\"d6\" value=\"d6\" aria-label=\"피해\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-track-name pb-roll\" data-roll-damage=\"d6\" title=\"피해 굴림\">피해</button></div></div><div class=\"fs-hp-mount\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">본능</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-instinct\" placeholder=\"to …\" aria-label=\"~하기\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-moves\"><span class=\"fs-label\">무브</span><ol><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-move0\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"무브\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-move1\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"무브\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-move2\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"무브\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ol></div>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">대가</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-cost\" placeholder=\"what keeps them following\" aria-label=\"계속 따르게 하는 것\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"f2-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">충성</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f2-loyalty-0\" title=\"충성 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f2-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"f2-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"충성 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f2-loyalty-1\" title=\"충성 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f2-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"f2-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"충성 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f2-loyalty-2\" title=\"충성 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f2-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"f2-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"충성 3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-gear\"><span class=\"fs-label\">장비</span><ul><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear0\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear2\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear3\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear4\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear5\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><span class=\"fs-label\">메모</span><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-notes\" rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"메모\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"players-agenda\">플레이어의 어젠다</h2>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>매력 있는 캐릭터를 그려 낸다</li><li>허구의 세계에 몸을 담근다</li><li>무슨 일이 벌어질지 알아내기 위해 플레이한다</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"players-principles\">플레이어의 원칙</h2>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>픽션에서 시작해 픽션으로 끝낸다</li><li>다른 PC들과 인연을 맺는다</li><li>너에게 소중한 것을 보여 준다</li><li>목표를 세우고 좇는다</li><li>대담하게, 위험을 무릅쓴다</li><li>곤경도, 좌절도, 실패도 끌어안는다</li><li>세계 만들기에 참여한다</li><li>다른 사람의 말 위에 쌓아 올린다</li><li>다른 사람에게도 빛날 기회를 준다</li><li>대화에 참여한다</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"when-in-doubt\">망설여질 때는…</h2>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>상황을 머릿속에 그려 본다</li><li>GM에게 설명을 청한다</li><li>무엇을 원하는가? 목표는 무엇인가?</li><li>자신의 강점과 약점을 헤아린다</li><li>다른 사람에게서 아이디어를 얻는다</li><li>뻔한 선택, 흥미로운 선택, 의미 있는 선택을 고른다… 늘 \"옳은\" 선택일 필요는 없다 (기억하라, 실패 굴림에서 XP를 얻는다!)</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"triggering-moves\">무브 발동하기</h2>\n<p>하고 싶다면, 픽션 속에서 하라. 어떻게 하는지, 어떤 모습인지 우리에게 말하라. 구체적으로.</p>\n<p>하지만 기억하라: 픽션 속에서 했다면, 정말로 해야 한다. \"하그르를 지나쳐 달려가 빛나는 검을 붙잡는다\"라고 말하면, GM은 그것이 DEX로 하는 위험에 맞서기라고 말한다. \"아, 그래요? 그럼 안 할래요\"라고 해도 괜찮다. 하지만 하그르를 지나쳐 달려가고 싶다면, 주사위를 굴려라.</p>\n<h2 id=\"hold-and-spend\">홀드와 소비</h2>\n<p>무브가 \"X를 홀드하라(~까지/~하는 동안/~인 한)\"라고 하면, 홀드한 것을 적어 두고 그 무브가 말하는 대로 소비한다. 홀드를 소비하면 대개 굴림 없이 그냥 해낸다.</p>\n<p>다만 때로는 홀드를 소비함으로써, 그러지 않고서는 할 수 없었을 무브를 발동해(굴림까지 해) 볼 수 있게 되기도 한다.</p>"
}
